so that's GREAT to read. https://t.co/AAYLXe1S4J", "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 250, "id": "1240412271022608385", "start": 235, "username": "PreciseHlthRpt"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/daisydwolf/sta…", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/daisydwolf/status/2117643062931230722", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/AAYLXe1S4J"}]}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117643062931230722", "type": "quoted"}], "url": "https://x.com/MattBMartin/status/2117745789036339342"}, {"author_id": "2009668550429147136", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:18:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117728255096574402"], "id": "2117728255096574402", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🧠 脑机接口再获大钱：暖芯迦拿下¥5亿 C+轮\n\n暖芯迦（杭州）研发帮助恢复视觉感知的脑机接口技术。本轮高榕资本领投，人保股权、渶策资本等跟投，老股东联想之星继续加注，累计融资约¥10亿。\n\n资金正从\"能读脑\"走向\"能治病\"，临床刚需型BCI更受产业资本青睐。\n\n#脑机接口 #融资 https://t.co/pEAunJCb1H", "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 137, "start": 132, "tag": "脑机接口"}, {"end": 141, "start": 138, "tag": "融资"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/pEAunJCb1H", "end": 165, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/INTJYAN/status/2117728255096574402/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117728253565669376", "start": 142, "url": "https://t.co/pEAunJCb1H"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/INTJYAN/status/2117728255096574402"}, {"author_id": "2095899578570821632", "created_at": "2026-11-04T01:05:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117785195944562696"], "id": "2117785195944562696", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "强脑科技将针对肥胖推出“电子”版本GLP-1\n\n中国神经技术公司强脑科技（BrainCo）正在开发一种可穿戴设备，该公司称该设备可通过刺激大脑来抑制食欲，将其定位为畅销 GLP-1 减肥疗法的潜在非药物替代方案。\n\n据创始合伙人 Nyx He 在彭博科技伦敦", "url": "https://x.com/Heheliq9cc/status/2117785195944562696"}, {"author_id": "1589635165495521280", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:00:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117753706909503761"], "id": "2117753706909503761", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 188, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "睡梦中醒来\n\n这一夜\n整晚都在做梦\n不受控制的大脑\n鬼压床一般\n睡得难受\n\n马斯克的脑机接口早日成功\n给我控制调节一下\n\n#醒来 #起床 #梦 #失眠 #睡眠 #脑机接口 #鬼压床", "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 64, "start": 61, "tag": "醒来"}, {"end": 68, "start": 65, "tag": "起床"}, {"end": 71, "start": 69, "tag": "梦"}, {"end": 75, "start": 72, "tag": "失眠"}, {"end": 79, "start": 76, "tag": "睡眠"}, {"end": 85, "start": 80, "tag": "脑机接口"}, {"end": 90, "start": 86, "tag": "鬼压床"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/AppStudio888/status/2117753706909503761"}, {"author_id": "1801498973469085696", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:50:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117736084935430221"], "id": "2117736084935430221", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "了解了脑机接口这个项目，挺有意思的 \n预言一下 未来可以与Ai一样常见，普及", "url": "https://x.com/MDMDDM33/status/2117736084935430221"}, {"author_id": "30777964", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:24:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117729615640985723"], "id": "2117729615640985723", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 57, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "人类需要脑机接口\n天天对着 AI 不是打字就是语音转文字\n\n还是太慢了，直接接上脑壳，瞬时交换输入输出。", "url": "https://x.com/x_GodSpeed_x/status/2117729615640985723"}, {"author_id": "2117572979722981376", "created_at": "2026-11-04T00:05:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117770047963775261"], "id": "2117770047963775261", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 555, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一龙的 @neuralink  又一位受试者出圈了\n\nJake 有渐冻症，手脚都操作不了轮椅\n现在他靠脑子里的芯片，用意念开着轮椅出门\n他说：「它让我又能陪儿子散步了」\n\n在湾区听了一年估值和融资，\n这是我在脑机接口公司兼职以来，第一次眼眶发热。\n\n技术的版本答案，从来都不是估值\n\nhttps://t.co/cEkbyuEVDZ", "entities": {"mentions": [{"end